[983.262,"o","ov stack destroy -y --delete-data\r\n"]
[983.308,"o","── PLAN · nothing below has run ───────────────────────────────────────\r\nThis is what will be deleted from your AWS account:\r\n\r\n  # The four masters, the load balancers, the media nodes' auto scaling group, the\r\n  # security groups and the secrets.\r\n  # The Route 53 record the stack created for openvidu-ha-test.dev.openvidu.io.\r\n  # The ACM certificate the stack requested for openvidu-ha-test.dev.openvidu.io.\r\n  # First let the media nodes go without draining their sessions.\r\n  aws autoscaling delete-lifecycle-hook --auto-scaling-group-name '$(aws cloudformation describe-stack-resource --stack-name openvidu-e2e-aws-ha-a102129 --logical-resource-id MediaNodeAutoScalingGroup --query StackResourceDetail.PhysicalResourceId --output text --region eu-south-2)' --lifecycle-hook-name openvidu-media-drain --region eu-south-2\r\n  aws cloudformation delete-stack --stack-name openvidu-e2e-aws-ha-a102129 --region eu-south-2\r\n\r\n  # The key pair this stack's deploy imported.\r\n  aws ec2 delete-key-pair --key-name openvidu-e2e-aws-ha-a102129-key --region eu-south-2\r\n\r\n  # The template this stack's deploy staged (the bucket stays: every stack in the\r\n  # region shares it).\r\n  aws s3 rm s3://openvidu-cfn-templates-***-eu-south-2/openvidu-e2e-aws-ha-a102129/ --recursive --only-show-errors --region eu-south-2\r\n\r\nWith --delete-data the S3 data buckets go too, with your recordings and Meet data and the\r\ncluster's metrics and logs, after the stack (the template marks them Retain,\r\nso the stack alone would leave them):\r\n  aws s3 rb s3://<each data bucket of the stack> --force --region eu-south-2\r\nThe destroy leaves the per-account bucket the deploy stages its template in\r\n(openvidu-cfn-templates-<account>-<region>): every stack in the region shares it.\r\n── end of plan ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\r\n"]
[983.943,"o","\r\n▶ Delete the machines on AWS…\r\n"]
[1017.763,"o","   · let the media nodes go without draining (a destroy ends every session)\r\n"]
[1018.921,"o","   · delete the CloudFormation stack openvidu-e2e-aws-ha-a102129 (four master instances, load balancers, media nodes' auto scaling group, security groups, secrets, Route 53 record, ACM certificate)\r\n"]
[1019.854,"o","   · wait for the resources to go\r\n"]
[1485.217,"o","   · deleted the bucket openvidu-appdata-443009e0 and everything in it\r\n"]
